<handout component="cur">
    <title>Tuesday 10/20</title>
    <objectives>
        <ul>
            <li>
                <p>
                    Review definitions of inverse functions.
                </p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <p>
                    Discuss the inverse trigonometric functions.
                </p>
            </li>
